usage: venturi qwen-native [-h] [--blocks-library BLOCKS_LIBRARY]
                           [--weight-mode {streaming,resident}]
                           [--dtype {fp16,bf16}] [--device DEVICE]
                           [--projection-profile {fp16,q8-residual,q8-residual-column-mlp,q8-residual-column-mlp-head-gdn}]
                           [--tensor-parallel-transport {peer,host}]
                           [--tensor-parallel-device TENSOR_PARALLEL_DEVICE]
                           [--pipeline-device PIPELINE_DEVICE]
                           [--pipeline-split-layer PIPELINE_SPLIT_LAYER]
                           [--pipeline-transport {host}]
                           [--mtp-artifact MTP_ARTIFACT]
                           [--mtp-draft-tokens {1,2}]
                           [--mtp-draft-projection-profile {fp16,q8-residual}]
                           [--mtp-recovery {replay,prefix}]
                           [--expected-sha256 EXPECTED_SHA256]
                           [--prompt PROMPT | --token-ids TOKEN_IDS]
                           [--tokenizer TOKENIZER]
                           [--eos-token-ids EOS_TOKEN_IDS]
                           [--max-new-tokens MAX_NEW_TOKENS]
                           [--max-tokens MAX_TOKENS] [--capacity CAPACITY]
                           {inspect,generate} path

Explicit owned Q8 native runtime; raw prompts and greedy-only generation.

positional arguments:
  {inspect,generate}
  path

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --blocks-library BLOCKS_LIBRARY
                        Explicit ABI-matching native library; never builds
                        automatically
  --weight-mode {streaming,resident}
                        Required for generation; never an implicit fallback
  --dtype {fp16,bf16}   Activation/KV dtype; SM70 needs explicit fp16
  --device DEVICE
  --projection-profile {fp16,q8-residual,q8-residual-column-mlp,q8-residual-column-mlp-head-gdn}
                        Original typed activation math (default), or explicit
                        experimental residual-A8 FP16 target arithmetic
  --tensor-parallel-transport {peer,host}
                        Explicit transport; peer mode verifies actual bytes
                        and never silently falls back
  --tensor-parallel-device TENSOR_PARALLEL_DEVICE
                        Optional explicit second CUDA device; resident TP only
  --pipeline-device PIPELINE_DEVICE
                        Explicit second CUDA device for native layer pipeline
  --pipeline-split-layer PIPELINE_SPLIT_LAYER
  --pipeline-transport {host}
  --mtp-artifact MTP_ARTIFACT
                        Explicit original-source Q8 MTP payload; experimental
                        native greedy verification
  --mtp-draft-tokens {1,2}
                        Explicit MTP proposal depth; depth one remains the
                        default
  --mtp-draft-projection-profile {fp16,q8-residual}
  --mtp-recovery {replay,prefix}
  --expected-sha256 EXPECTED_SHA256
                        Optional full-file pin for a single-file artifact
  --prompt PROMPT       Raw continuation prompt: no automatic chat template
  --token-ids TOKEN_IDS
                        Comma-separated already formatted prompt IDs; no
                        tokenizer dependency
  --tokenizer TOKENIZER
                        Local tokenizer.json for raw text input/decoding; no
                        network or model code
  --eos-token-ids EOS_TOKEN_IDS
                        Comma-separated EOS IDs; default from text config,
                        empty string explicitly disables stopping
  --max-new-tokens MAX_NEW_TOKENS
  --max-tokens MAX_TOKENS
                        Native prefill chunk/arena size, not context capacity
  --capacity CAPACITY   Default prompt length + max-new-tokens; no truncation
